1.4 Description of the Project Area
St. Mary's Girls Secondary School is located in Thigio area, Ndeiya Sub-County, Kiambu County.
Climatic Characteristics
Factor	Description
Altitude	Approximately 2,000 m above sea level
Rainfall	Moderate but increasingly erratic
Temperature	Hot conditions with occasional cold stress
Main Economic Activity	Crop and livestock farming
Common Livestock	Dairy cattle, poultry, goats and sheep
Agricultural Characteristics
The area supports:
•	Dairy farming.
•	Poultry production.
•	Maize production.
•	Horticulture.
•	Vegetable farming.
Poultry farming is common due to:
•	Availability of markets.
•	Availability of feed ingredients.
•	Small land requirements.
•	Fast returns on investment.
